          {
            "title": "Naming",
            "id": 88828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Semelhante à nomeação de variáveis e funções, existem algumas práticas comuns ao definir classes.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher = Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Person</code> seguido de <code>Person</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você segue práticas comuns ao nomear classes, assim como faz com variáveis e funções.</p><p>Defina a classe <code>Person</code> e depois crie um professor a partir dela.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher = Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"self\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>class</code> seguido de <code>Person</code> e finalmente <code>Person</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Class name",
            "id": 89046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os nomes das classes geralmente têm a primeira letra em maiúscula e o restante em minúsculas, como com <code>Person</code> aqui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Person</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Descriptive",
            "id": 88823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assim como variáveis, tentamos nomear classes de forma descritiva.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, author, title)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.author = author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.title = title\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"B\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>class</code> seguido de <code>Book</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você escolhe nomes descritivos para classes, assim como faz com variáveis.</p><p>Comece uma classe chamada <code>Book</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, author, title)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.author = author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.title = title\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"author\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>class</code> seguido de <code>Book</code> e finalmente <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Consistent",
            "id": 89048,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assim como ao nomear variáveis e funções, devemos nomear as coisas de forma consistente e prestar atenção à capitalização.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayHello\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayBye\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bye&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher = Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher.sayBye()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"206\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option startIndex=\"212\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option startIndex=\"213\" endIndex=\"214\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Saybye\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bye\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>sayBye</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você nomeia classes e métodos de forma consistente e observa as maiúsculas, assim como com variáveis e funções.</p><p>Faça o código exibir <code>Bye</code> chamando o método certo em <code>teacher</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, age)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayHello\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"sayBye\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bye&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher = Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Emily&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"teacher.sayBye()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"198\" endIndex=\"205\" /><option startIndex=\"206\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option startIndex=\"212\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option startIndex=\"213\" endIndex=\"214\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Person\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"sayHello\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bye\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>teacher</code> seguido de <code>sayBye</code>, <code>(</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Other features",
            "id": 88771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assim como métodos fora de classes, você pode usar as funções embutidas e os recursos principais do Python.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, flavor, ingredients)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.flavor = flavor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.ingredients = ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print_ingredients\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" self.ingredients:    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie = Pie(\" /><text value=\"'apple'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", [\" /><text value=\"'flour'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'eggs'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'apples'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'butter'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie.print_ingredients()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"155\" /><option startIndex=\"156\" endIndex=\"158\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"flour\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"eggs\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apples\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"butter\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>for</code> seguido de <code>i</code> e finalmente <code>in</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assim como métodos fora de classes, você pode usar as funções embutidas e os recursos principais do Python.</p><p>Dentro de um método, uma instância acessa os próprios dados com <code>self</code>.</p><p>Faça um loop pelos ingredientes da torta para o código exibir cada um.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, flavor, ingredients)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.flavor = flavor\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.ingredients = ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print_ingredients\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" self.ingredients:    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"      print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie = Pie(\" /><text value=\"'apple'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", [\" /><text value=\"'flour'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'eggs'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'apples'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'butter'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"applePie.print_ingredients()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"159\" endIndex=\"175\" /><option startIndex=\"187\" endIndex=\"192\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display_ingredients\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"self.flavor\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"flour\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"eggs\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apples\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"butter\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>print_ingredients</code> seguido de <code>for</code>, <code>self.ingredients</code> e finalmente <code>print</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 88796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com este código?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"Person():\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A palavra-chave <code>class</code> está faltando</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não há nada de errado com este código</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A palavra-chave <code>class</code> está faltando.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma definição de classe começa com a palavra-chave <code>class</code>, seguida do nome e de dois-pontos.</p><p>A primeira linha é <code>Person():</code>. O que deve ser corrigido antes de o código definir <code>Person</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"Person():\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Adicione a palavra-chave <code>class</code> e use um cabeçalho de classe</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nada, porque parênteses sozinhos definem uma classe</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Passe <code>self</code> ao chamar <code>Person(29, 5)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Mova <code>print(jess.age)</code> para dentro da definição da classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Adicione a palavra-chave <code>class</code> e use um cabeçalho de classe.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 88794,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Com quantos valores podemos chamar o construtor <code>Person</code> sem alterar a classe dada?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"29\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">3</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher 2.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O Python fornece <code>self</code> automaticamente quando você cria uma instância.</p><p>Se você alterar a chamada para <code>Person(29)</code>, por que ela falhará?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Person\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, age, height)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.age = age\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  self.height = height\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"jess = Person(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(jess.age)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"29\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ela fornece age, mas deixa height sem valor</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ela fornece self, mas deixa age e height sem valores</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ela fornece height, mas deixa age sem valor</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Ela precisa de um valor para Person antes de age e height</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ela fornece age, mas deixa height sem valor.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 88795,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais recursos principais da linguagem Python podemos usar dentro de uma classe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Todos os recursos principais da linguagem Python</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nós apenas conseguimos criar variáveis</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Todos os recursos principais da linguagem Python.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar todos os recursos principais do Python dentro de uma classe.</p><p>Um método de classe precisa de um loop e de uma instrução <code>if</code> para processar uma lista. Esse design é permitido?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sim, métodos podem usar esses recursos principais do Python</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não, uma classe pode conter variáveis, mas não fluxo de controle</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não, loops só são permitidos fora de definições de classe</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Sim, mas somente se o loop e a condição forem escritos fora do método</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sim, métodos podem usar esses recursos principais do Python.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 88792,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual dessas não é uma boa prática de nomenclatura para classes?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nomear suas classes com palavras-chave reservadas da linguagem como <code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Capitalizando a primeira letra de um nome de classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nomear suas classes com palavras-chave reservadas da linguagem como <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nomes de classe geralmente começam com letra maiúscula, e palavras-chave reservadas do Python não podem ser usadas como nomes.</p><p>Um desenvolvedor propõe chamar uma classe de <code>if</code>. Por que esse nome deve ser rejeitado?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>if</code> é uma palavra-chave reservada da linguagem</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Todo nome de classe deve conter um sublinhado</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Python permite apenas nomes de tipos embutidos para classes</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Nomes de classe em minúsculas sempre são erros de sintaxe, mesmo quando não são palavras-chave</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>if</code> é uma palavra-chave reservada da linguagem.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 89488,
            "contentType": "interactive",
